# impeccable-ignore-start
# Keep shared config/design/surface/critique markdown; exclude per-machine runtime.
**/.impeccable/config.local.json
**/.impeccable/hook.cache.json
**/.impeccable/hook.pending.json
**/.impeccable/*.png
**/.impeccable/review/
